-- The language strings.
--
-- languagesystem was completely empty, so every message the core routes
-- through translation fell back to whatever the script hardcoded, or to the
-- raw key. This is the UI and system text: script messages, the Master Level
-- window, trainer and quest descriptions.
--
-- English only, deliberately. The dump carries seven languages but the
-- accented characters in the non-English rows are already destroyed at
-- source -- German reads 'K??nige' where it should read 'Koenige' -- so
-- importing them would load 10,092 rows of damaged text to no benefit. The
-- 5,893 English rows are clean.
--
-- Nothing here overwrites: our mobs carry no TranslationId at all and
-- exactly one item does, so this adds text where there was none.

