(UUID(),'Training instruments will increase the damage of musical spells and offers speed, health and mana songs, that increase your regeneration of each. Included in this line are memorizations spells, which will hold your enemy captive during combat. What else can I tell you about? [Stealth], [Slash], [Thrust], [Instruments], or are you [done]?','Alb.GreetingsMinstrel.Description.Instruments','EN','Constantine''s Sound Quests','2000-01-01 00:00:00'),
