(UUID(),'The matter line holds your damage over time (Dot) spells. It also contains a damage and snare spell list. These spells will damage and slow an enemies'' movement speed. Matter also contains instant stat debuff spells. What else can I tell you about? [Body], [Matter], [Mind] or are you [done]?','Alb.GreetingsSorcerer.Description.Matter','EN','Constantine''s Sound Quests','2000-01-01 00:00:00'),
